  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Human Development Assessment Structural Reform Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to (i) Provide a brief stocktaking assessment of human development challenges in each EaP country; (ii) Based on the assessment, organize a consultation process in each country to identify human development reforms and investment priorities; and (iii) Identify, assess and raise awareness about selected human development challenges common across the EaP countries and potential cross-cutting solutions.</narrative>
  </description>
